If $\mathrm{x} \in \mathrm{I},\lceil\mathrm{x}\rceil=[\mathrm{x}]$ (greatest integer function)

If $x \notin I,\lceil x\rceil=[x]+1$

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \mathrm{f}(\mathrm{x})=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
